    "body": "# 0.3\n\n## 发布维护\n- fix hardcoded renamed paths\n- trigger on bare numeric tags too\n\n## 文档与其他\n- v0.3: 保活区块（Immortalizer 核心收编，反挂起+防杀+开关）+ BBBulletin 原生横幅（微信图标/点击跳转/锁屏/方案1声音）\n- 0.3: background banner via UILocalNotification (fix compile, drop UN path)\n- 0.3: background banner restore — local notification from B hook when app inactive (group=speaker, chat=contact); UNUserNotifications auth on ctor\n- simplify README\n- rewrite README as WXRelay\n- 0.2: final residue sweep (scripts tempdir, ctor name)\n- 0.2: rebrand tests/scripts/tool-hooks; remove dead root files\n- 0.2: full rebrand — NF* classes/dirs/dylibs/bundle renamed to WX* (WXRelay.dylib/WXRelayPrefs.bundle/WXRelaySender), zero NotificationFilter residue; 2.9.0 source archived\n\n## 完整提交列表\n- 比较范围：`0.1...0.3`\n- 对比链接：https://github.com/777qwq/WXRelay/compare/0.1...0.3\n"
